## Third-party manuscript images and metadata

Images from Bibliothèque nationale de France / Gallica are not redistributed
in this repository. The project references the provider's IIIF resources.
Required source credit: "Source gallica.bnf.fr / Bibliothèque nationale de France".
Non-commercial reuse, academic use, commercial reuse, and reuse of
provider metadata are governed by the current Gallica and BnF terms:

https://gallica.bnf.fr/accueil/fr/html/conditions-dutilisation-de-gallica

Images and provider metadata from Smithsonian National Museum of Asian Art are
not redistributed in this repository. The viewer references the provider's
IIIF resources for FSC-MS-28. The object is marked "Usage Conditions Apply";
reuse must follow the Smithsonian Terms of Use, including source citation and
the restrictions applicable to commercial use:

https://asia.si.edu/explore-art-culture/collections/search/edanmdm:fsg_FSC-MS-28/
https://www.si.edu/termsofuse

The licenses in this repository apply only to material for which the project
author holds the relevant rights. They do not license the remotely referenced
manuscript images or replace third-party terms.
